          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontsize='12'>50% of our customers have filed between 633K  and 1.780K total claim amounts, with the median being small cars at 863K.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>Outliers are represented by medium cars with over 2.600K total claim amount and large cars with over 400K total claim amount</run>
            <run>.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
